This folder is Wrangler's local build/dev cache directory. It's created
(and populated) automatically the first time you run `wrangler dev` or
`wrangler pages deploy` — this placeholder file just keeps the empty
folder present in the repo/zip before that happens. Everything else
Wrangler writes in here is git-ignored (see .gitignore) since it's
machine-specific generated state, not source code.
